        <p>We are not offering a single isolated application. We provide a scalable ecosystem designed to eliminate the epidemiological data gap[cite: 1, 2]:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Layer 1: Teenology</strong> — A mutual-trust mobile application for parents and teenagers focused on prevention[cite: 1].</li>
          <li><strong>Layer 2: Specialist Workspaces</strong> — AI-assisted offline CRM terminals for school psychologists[cite: 1].</li>
          <li><strong>Layer 3: IDA Kit</strong> — An intelligent software suite tailored for commercial psychological centers[cite: 1].</li>
          <li><strong>Layer 4: Territorial Dashboards</strong> — Macro-analytics and risk heatmaps for school directors and regional ministries[cite: 1].</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Why this is a Perfect Asset for the Chinese Market (PIPL Compliant)</h2>
        <p>The system was architected to bypass the traditional bottlenecks of cloud-based AI in highly regulated regions:</p>
        <ul>
