          <li><strong>Shadow Scoring Diagnostics:</strong> The AI analyzes natural free-flowing speech and programmatically maps it onto strict clinical metrics[cite: 1, 2], automating Form 5 and FBA/BIP reports without relying on static, easily manipulated questionnaires.</li>
        </ul>

